 forget things and limits what they  the government agency the southern rage  is super mysterious and manipulative  they lie to the group withhold  information it's almost like they're  experimenting on the expedition members  as much as on the area and the  protagonist the biologist is a  complicated highly introverted character  she's sometimes an unreliable narrator  who misleads the reader so the book is  super psychological tense and paranoid  but it's also about the environment for  all the drama and mystery the story is  also a love letter to the beauty and the  strangeness of nature so if you want to  go deeper into area X you can listen to  the annihilation novel now for free at  audible.com/asap look of your choice  with a free trial and they have  thousands of audiobooks on offer if  you've already read annihilation you  might like the little-known Game of  Thrones series and it's spin-off books  like Duncan egg in the world book to  check amount sign up at audible.com  slash ASX or text ASX to 500 500 thanks  to matty asthma for this light house  artwork and thanks to the patrons  including skyler Rudovsky  candace brook matt Hankel and kick  master she is  you
 

